From: gororoba-quantum maintainers
Subject: [PATCH] Resolve compiler diagnostics under GCC 16 and NVCC 13.4 fatal warning policy

Resolves 57 fatal diagnostics under -Wall -Wextra -Werror and --Werror all-warnings:
- Implicit fallthrough in switch cases across operations.hpp, noise_model.hpp, state_controller.hpp
- Missing non-void return path in noise_model.hpp::sample_channel under NVCC EDG frontend
- Pessimizing std::move(pydata) returns in pybind mixins preventing copy elision
- Pybind11 deprecated get_type() calls converted to py::type::handle_of(obj)
- OpenMP loop bounds variable declarations placed before parallel for pragmas
- Base class copy constructor initializers in DensityMatrix and UnitaryMatrix
- Signed/unsigned integer comparisons resolved via static_cast<size_t>/static_cast<int>
- Chunk copy assignment operator explicitly defaulted to prevent deprecated-copy propagation
- Thrust iterator_traits difference_type qualification in thrust_kernels.hpp
- Scoped dangling-reference suppression around json deserialization calls
---
